格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"是一层高自由度的玻璃质感主题，套在 DeepSeek Harness 网页端。顶栏、侧边栏、输入框、统计行、轨迹视图都成了磨砂玻璃片。玻璃模糊度、磨砂度、背景（流体或自定义壁纸，壁纸还能单独调模糊和磨砂）全都能在设置卡片里自由调节。关掉开关就回到原生界面，不改 DSH 任何一行源码。","id":"gh:1334249383","install_available":false,"language":"JavaScript","name":"DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin","slug":"WYH66666666/DSH-Transparent-UI-Plugin","topics":["deepseek-harness","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh","dsh-plugin","theme"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"是一层高自由度的玻璃质感主题，套在 DeepSeek Harness 网页端。顶栏、侧边栏、输入框、统计行、轨迹视图都成了磨砂玻璃片。玻璃模糊度、磨砂度、背景（流体或自定义壁纸，壁纸还能单独调模糊和磨"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"砂）全都能在设置卡片里自由调节。关掉开关就回到原生界面，不改 DSH 任何一行源码。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-aqua"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"# Notice ⚠️: As DSH has been updated, I am unable to promptly update the plugin with the new APIdue "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"to my academic commitments. Please use an alternative agent to replace or repair it yourself to avoi"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"d crashes when installing this plugin."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Aqua is a highly customizable glassmorphism theme for the DeepSeek Harness web UI. The header, sideb"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ar, composer, stats line, and trajectory view all become panes of frosted glass. you can put video f"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"or wallpaper and Switch it off and the stock UI comes back exactly, with no source changes to DSH it"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"llpaper and Switch it off and the stock UI comes back exactly, with no source changes to DSH itself."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Two modes**: **Mica** restyles the layout into floating glass cards (blur and frost adjustable),"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" while **Compatibility Mode** keeps the stock layout byte-for-byte and only swaps the material to ge"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"neric glass — other plugins' UI gets the same treatment automatically\n- **Free backdrop**: a living "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"fluid board (hue adjustable) or your own wallpaper (fills the page, aspect preserved, with its own b"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"lur and frost); light wallpapers look best in light mode, dark wallpapers in dark mode\n- **Backgroun"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"d brightness**: follows the resolved scheme — dark mode darkens (0–50), light mode brightens (50–100"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"), 50 is unchanged\n- **Particle whale**: the deepseek.com/harness centerpiece fish (a 2D port of the"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" site's particle engine), centered in the chat area right of the sidebar — white particles on dark, "},{"id":"p7s9","text":"gray on light, toggleable in settings\n- **Glossy \"Harness\" badge**: in dark mode the sidebar wordmar"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"k wears the official nameplate pill (135° gradient ring + soft glow); light mode keeps the stock pla"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"te\n- **Edge fades**: 5px gradient blur bands pinned to the top and bottom of the page, above the cha"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"t content — scrolling content melts into the edges; faint white veil on light, faint black on dark\n-"},{"id":"p7s13","text":" One switch: off restores the stock UI exactly, and every effect is removed with the plugin"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Option 1: npm one-liner (recommended)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Installs the latest version from npm and registers it as a profile plugin layer (`dsh.bundle` patch)"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" — works on every platform. Reload the web UI and it is on."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Option 2: GitHub installer (fallback)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"No npm account and no git needed (falls back to a plain zip download)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Windows (one command):**"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Installs the **latest release** by default. The script links the plugin into the profile's `node_mod"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ules` and registers `ui-aqua` in `cordis.patch.yml` (idempotent — safe to run again)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Pin a version or track the dev branch:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"**macOS / Linux (manual, three steps):**"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"then append to `$DSH_HOME/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Reload the web UI. Aqua is **on by default**; the master switch lives in **Settings → Plugins → Glas"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"s theme** (same shape as the other plugin cards), and every other control sits directly under **Sett"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ings → General → Appearance** (no title of its own): mode, blur/frost (Mica mode), fluid color, back"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ground brightness, backdrop (fluid/wallpaper) with its wallpaper controls, and the particle-whale to"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ggle. With the master switch off, the whole control block under Appearance is hidden."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
